{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":17,"voice":"en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural","engine":"edge","duration":315.168,"segs":[{"b":0,"part":0,"text":"Arjuna said: What is the mode of devotion of those who perform spiritual practices with faith, but without following the scriptural injunctions, O Krishna? Is it in the mode of goodness, passion, or ignorance?","start":0.0,"dur":14.208,"words":[[0.075,0.438,"Arjuna"],[0.525,0.35,"said"],[1.488,0.113,"What"],[1.613,0.1,"is"],[1.725,0.087,"the"],[1.825,0.225,"mode"],[2.062,0.062,"of"],[2.138,0.525,"devotion"],[2.675,0.087,"of"],[2.775,0.35,"those"],[3.138,0.087,"who"],[3.237,0.512,"perform"],[3.763,0.588,"spiritual"],[4.362,0.55,"practices"],[4.912,0.163,"with"],[5.075,0.425,"faith"],[5.9,0.25,"but"],[6.513,0.338,"without"],[6.862,0.425,"following"],[7.3,0.075,"the"],[7.388,0.487,"scriptural"],[7.888,0.7,"injunctions"],[9.113,0.15,"O"],[9.275,0.537,"Krishna"],[10.188,0.138,"Is"],[10.338,0.075,"it"],[10.425,0.087,"in"],[10.525,0.062,"the"],[10.588,0.25,"mode"],[10.85,0.113,"of"],[10.975,0.537,"goodness"],[11.775,0.637,"passion"],[12.85,0.275,"or"],[13.213,0.613,"ignorance"]]},{"b":1,"part":0,"text":"Three types of faith","start":14.208,"dur":1.872,"words":[[0.1,0.338,"Three"],[0.45,0.35,"types"],[0.812,0.1,"of"],[0.925,0.475,"faith"]]},{"b":2,"part":0,"text":"The Supreme Lord said: The natural faith of embodied beings is of three kinds: Goodness, passion, and ignorance. Now hear about these from Me. O Arjuna, the faith of each is in accordance with one’s own natural disposition governed by Karmic impressions. One is known by one’s faith. One can become whatever one wants to be — if one constantly contemplates the object of desire with faith. Persons in the mode of goodness worship celestial controllers; those in the mode of passion worship supernatural rulers and demons; and those in the mode of ignorance worship ghosts and spirits. Ignorant persons of demonic nature are those who practice severe austerities without following the prescription of the scriptures, who are full of hypocrisy and egotism, who are impelled by the force of desire and attachment, and who senselessly torture the elements in their body and also Me who dwells within the body.","start":16.08,"dur":56.808,"words":[[0.1,0.062,"The"],[0.175,0.438,"Supreme"],[0.625,0.25,"Lord"],[0.875,0.35,"said"],[1.738,0.087,"The"],[1.837,0.487,"natural"],[2.337,0.35,"faith"],[2.7,0.125,"of"],[2.837,0.463,"embodied"],[3.312,0.45,"beings"],[3.775,0.125,"is"],[3.913,0.138,"of"],[4.062,0.388,"three"],[4.463,0.562,"kinds"],[5.5,0.562,"Goodness"],[6.412,0.588,"passion"],[7.013,0.175,"and"],[7.25,0.662,"ignorance"],[8.3,0.237,"Now"],[8.55,0.263,"hear"],[8.825,0.225,"about"],[9.062,0.188,"these"],[9.262,0.138,"from"],[9.4,0.275,"Me"],[10.062,0.2,"O"],[10.262,0.525,"Arjuna"],[11.262,0.113,"the"],[11.387,0.388,"faith"],[11.787,0.113,"of"],[11.988,0.362,"each"],[12.438,0.087,"is"],[12.537,0.062,"in"],[12.613,0.575,"accordance"],[13.2,0.138,"with"],[13.35,0.35,"one’s"],[13.787,0.287,"own"],[14.075,0.362,"natural"],[14.45,0.662,"disposition"],[15.125,0.425,"governed"],[15.55,0.2,"by"],[15.762,0.512,"Karmic"],[16.288,0.725,"impressions"],[17.387,0.237,"One"],[17.637,0.138,"is"],[17.788,0.375,"known"],[18.175,0.188,"by"],[18.375,0.425,"one’s"],[18.812,0.463,"faith"],[19.663,0.3,"One"],[19.975,0.237,"can"],[20.225,0.438,"become"],[20.663,0.4,"whatever"],[21.075,0.212,"one"],[21.3,0.225,"wants"],[21.538,0.087,"to"],[21.637,0.3,"be"],[22.475,0.175,"if"],[22.65,0.3,"one"],[22.962,0.6,"constantly"],[23.575,0.675,"contemplates"],[24.262,0.138,"the"],[24.462,0.5,"object"],[24.975,0.087,"of"],[25.062,0.5,"desire"],[25.575,0.163,"with"],[25.738,0.45,"faith"],[26.6,0.438,"Persons"],[27.05,0.113,"in"],[27.163,0.062,"the"],[27.225,0.287,"mode"],[27.525,0.1,"of"],[27.625,0.412,"goodness"],[28.05,0.438,"worship"],[28.5,0.562,"celestial"],[29.075,0.613,"controllers"],[30.137,0.263,"those"],[30.4,0.062,"in"],[30.475,0.062,"the"],[30.55,0.275,"mode"],[30.837,0.113,"of"],[30.962